# Exact relative paths, one per line -- no globs, no directories. Anything
# that would need a whole directory kept out lives in a dot-directory
# instead (.devtools), which pack skips outright the way it skips .git: a
# hand-written list of scratch files goes stale silently, and the file
# somebody forgets to add is the one that ships.
#
# Exact relative paths, one per line: tests are for the checkout, not the
# shipped package. Screenshots are for the README and the index listing --
# players download them once from GitHub, not with every mod update.
tests/npc_bubbles_test.lua
docs/screenshot-town.png
